Note: the `design-reference/` directory contains separate, third-party
MIT-licensed projects by 8B (https://8b.com). Each keeps its own licence and
credits, unmodified, inside its own subdirectory:

  design-reference/scooter-template/LICENSE     (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 8B)
  design-reference/scooter-template/CREDITS.md  (photo, font, library attributions)

  design-reference/fashion-brand-template/LICENSE     (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 8B)
  design-reference/fashion-brand-template/CREDITS.md  (photo, font, library attributions)

Both are static HTML design-language references, unmodified. The photographs
they reference are licensed separately under the Unsplash License and are NOT
covered by this project's MIT licence.
